'''Asikyira''', officially the '''Asikyiran Republic''' ({{Langx|wo|Nguuru Asikiir}}) is a country located at the western tip of the continent of [[Abyala]]. Asikyira is the ??-most populous country in the [[Western Hemisphere]] and the fourth-largest by total area. The capital of [[Sanu-Sasso]], while its most-populous city is [[Kuluba]].

